 "description": "Counterfactual management-treatment scenario applied to the 2024 western-CONUS baseline: a modeled what-if outcome, not an observed state. Maximum possible annual evapotranspiration given the observed vegetation structure, assuming no drought limitation. Depends only on vegetation structure, not year-to-year precipitation. Regression-based on AmeriFlux, monthly Landsat, and PRISM. Units: mm/yr.",
